<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Sequim SD 323, Wash.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Sequim SD 323, Wash.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it received the written award for $7 million of Sequim School District No. 323, Wash., general obligation bonds, with a top yield of 5.60 in 2014.</p>
</text>
